1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,744
Other devices to quote.

2
00:00:01,744 --> 00:00:06,276
Dramatic irony: we guess about the thorns before Evans does.

3
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:11,080
Situational irony: they die of the very thing that protects the treasure.

4
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,968
Suspense around the corpse.

5
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:17,096
Pathetic fallacy: the silent forest seems to watch.

6
00:00:17,096 --> 00:00:19,791
Understatement: somebody has been here before.

7
00:00:19,791 --> 00:00:22,981
And an open ending that the reader completes.

